":{"text":"<p>Founded in 2016 by longtime friends August Ullrich and Philip Morsink, O’Donnell Moonshine is the home of smooth and delicious spirits and liqueurs, made with an uncompromising attention to detail and only the finest, carefully selected ingredients. <br\/><br\/>During a road trip through the United States, our founders came across the fascinating story of the prohibition and the rise of Moonshine.<\/p><p><br\/>Upon arriving home, still gripped by the history, they decided to revive this once infamous beverage with a modern twist and bring its legacy to the present day. Bottling the first jars at home, the brand O’Donnell Moonshine was born.<\/p><p>Since then, our unique jars and fabulous flavours have converted thousands of fans, and we have gone from strength to strength. We can't wait to see what the next few years have in store!<br\/><\/p>"}}},"block_order":["text_BDWBhc"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"background-2","full_width":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":40}},"e9f22c61-c502-4749-b2ab-327c29671fdd":{"type":"multicolumn","blocks":{"template--16188960833804__e9f22c61-c502-4749-b2ab-327c29671fdd-1666259907a8b67b99-0":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/012669d2-d336-4e84-8920-bb1393cba7f8.jpg","overlay_title":false,"overlay_title_position":"bottom","title":"Our Team in Manchester","text":"","mobile_text":"<p>Pair text with an image to focus on your chosen product, collection, or blog post. Add details on availability, style, or even provide a review.<\/p>","link_label":"","link":"","button_alignment":"left","selected_button":false,"grey_out_media":false}},"template--16188960833804__e9f22c61-c502-4749-b2ab-327c29671fdd-1666259907a8b67b99-1":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Manchester_EmployerBranding-03.webp","overlay_title":false,"overlay_title_position":"bottom","title":"Our Manchester office","text":"","mobile_text":"<p>Pair text with an image to focus on your chosen product, collecti